+  startup current 900 mA; startup duration 45 ms), **Rail Demo limits Rev A ARCHIVED** and
+  **Rail Demo limits Rev B CURRENT** (Rev B allows 4 W settled and 40 ms of startup; Rev A allowed 5 W and 60 ms).
